       }
      ],
      "text": "Gabapentin:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " resp depression may occur w CNS depressants, incl opioids, or w underlying resp impairment; monitor and adjust the dose as appropriate."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
