    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Antiepileptic drugs, incl gabapentin, increase the risk of suicidal thoughts or behavior. Monitor for new or worse depression, suicidal thoughts or behavior, or unusual chgs in mood or behavior."
     }
